## Frida

### 基础
- `frida-ps -U` — 列进程
- `frida -U -f com.target -l hook.js` — 启动并注入
- `frida -U com.target` — 附加

### Java Hook
```js
Java.perform(() => {
  const C = Java.use('com.target.Crypto');
  C.sign.overload('java.lang.String').implementation = function(s) {
    console.log('input:', s);
    const r = this.sign(s);
    console.log('output:', r);
    return r;
  };
});
```

### Native Hook
```js
Interceptor.attach(Module.findExportByName('libc.so', 'open'), {
  onEnter(args) { console.log('open:', args[0].readCString()); },
  onLeave(retval) { console.log('ret:', retval); }
});
```

### SSL Pinning绕过
- `frida -U -f com.target -l ssl_bypass.js --no-pause`
- objection：`android sslpinning disable`
